a) Mix all components together in a bowl;
b) Add cold water to mix well;
c) Stir gently while stirring vigorously so that no lumps remain after mixing;
d) Pour the finished product onto plastic containers filled with ice cubes;
e) Store them in cool dry storage bags covered with paper towels.

